  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commission on the Status of Women Side Event 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN:s kvinnokommissionen seminariet 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN:s 56:e sammantr&#xe4;de f&#xf6;r kommissionen f&#xf6;r kvinnans st&#xe4;llning (CSW) skall h&#xe5;llas under 27/2 - 9/3 2012. Temat &#xe4;r &apos;Egenmakt f&#xf6;r kvinnor p&#xe5; landsbygden&apos;. Sverige anser CSW som en viktig normgivande m&#xf6;tesplats, samt att temat har h&#xf6;g relevans f&#xf6;r v&#xe5;rt bist&#xe5;nd. Sida skall d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r, i samr&#xe5;d med ubildningsdepartementet, arrangerar Sveriges sidoevenmang p&#xe5; CSW.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNs 56th meeting of the Commission on the Status of Women (CSW) is to held during the 27/2 - 9/3 2012. The theme is &apos;Empowerment of Rural Women&apos;. Sweden views the CSW as an important normative event, as well as that the theme has high relevance for our development cooperation. Sida will therefore arrange Sweden&apos;s side-event at the CSW.</narrative>
  </description>
